[h1]Project Vigilance: Aquatic Operations & Sonar[/h1]
[b]Activates RimWorld's oceans with directional coastal sonar arrays, water-connected acoustic propagation, and maritime early-warning outposts.[/b]
Requires [i]Project Vigilance - Core Framework[/i]. Interconnects automatically with [i]Geoscape & Early Warning[/i] when active.
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Key Features[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Coastal Hydrophone Arrays:[/b] Dedicated custom-sprite battlescape [i]Coastal Hydrophone Station[/i] requiring shoreline/water adjacency to extend planetary maritime surveillance.
[*] [b]Directional Water-Connected Sonar Propagation:[/b] Zero-allocation acoustic flood-fill propagates strictly across connected ocean and coastal water tiles without leaking over land barriers or mountains.
[*] [b]Automated Coastal Sonar Outposts:[/b] Deployable maritime sonar stations via caravan and colony expedition menus on coastal hexes (currently gated behind Development Mode during Milestone 1.5 preview).
[*] [b]WCAG 2.2 AA Palette Integration:[/b] Renders distinct sonar perimeter and honeycomb overlays that dynamically track your active Project Vigilance colour or colourblind theme.
[*] [b]Foundation for Terror from the Deep:[/b] Establishes the modular acoustic and maritime infrastructure for upcoming USOs, submersibles, and seabed salvage operations.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Compatibility & Load Order[/h2]
[olist]
[*] Harmony
[*] Core & Official DLCs (all optional)
[*] Project Vigilance - Core Framework
[*] Project Vigilance - Geoscape & Early Warning (recommended for planetary sonar overlays)
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Aquatic Operations & Sonar[/b]
[/olist]
[hr][/hr]
